LOCUS       CloDF13_ori              630 bp    DNA              UNK 01-JAN-1980
DEFINITION  The CloDF13 (ColE1-family) origin of replication: the 630 bp region
            from the RNA II promoter -35 to the RNA-to-DNA transition, with the
            RNA I / RNA II antisense pair that sets copy number; the origin of
            the pCDF/CDFDuet vectors, compatible with ColE1/pMB1 and p15A
            origins..
ACCESSION   CloDF13_ori
VERSION     CloDF13_ori
